        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: blacklisted screenwriter, Michael Wilson, Richard E. Cunha\n- Films: Sredni Vashtar, When I Grow Up\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Live Action Short Film\n\nFacts:\n- In 1942, a blacklisted screenwriter won the Academy Award for Best Live Action Short Film.\n- The film Sredni Vashtar was later nominated for the Academy Award for Best Live Action Short Film.\n- The blacklisted screenwriter shared the 1942 Academy Award for Best Live Action Short Film with the writer and director of the 1951 film When I Grow Up.\n- The writer and director of the 1951 film When I Grow Up was Michael Wilson.\n- Richard E. Cunha directed the 1951 film When I Grow Up.",
